{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56865","headline":"河南民爲河南尹某公歌（题从《古谣谚》卷八一拟） · 佚名","name":"河南民爲河南尹某公歌（题从《古谣谚》卷八一拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天灾流行兮代有，下民昏垫兮时数。\n命无以远兮谅自嗟，岂将天怒，我尹之慰恤兮，实解予之愁苦。\n夫得耕兮妇织，日出得作兮日入得息。\n此固我君之忧民兮，俾我尹之来即。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56865.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56865","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}